#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""owe — from a commit or a diff, list natal cohorts still unpaid at HEAD.

Reverse of pointing at FILE:LINE. The change is the query: every birth
cohort it touches is scored against HEAD, and kin that still hold an
abandoned token (or a birth family that has since split) are the debt.
"""

